  "title": "Agent Offers, Calls and Wrap-Up in the Contact Center | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "How an agent works a piece of work in the CrestApps Contact Center: the offer, the call, calls from the dialer, protecting card details on a recorded call, and wrap-up. Offers and live calls need a connected phone provider, so this video describes those screens with slides and shows the screens that exist without a call.\n\nIn this video:\n• Answering or declining an offer, and what happens when nobody answers\n• Calls from a dialer campaign: preview, power and progressive\n• Protecting card details: pause the recording, or collect data securely\n• Wrap-up and completing the activity\n• Reviewing recent activity in My workspace and the soft phone",
